flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[User enters word list]
    B --> C[Normalize input: uppercase, split by whitespace/comma]
    C --> D[Validate word list]

    D -->|Invalid| E[Show error message]
    E --> B

    D -->|Valid| F[Store masterList and currentList]
    F --> G[Show runtime UI and hide input section]
    G --> H[Render candidate word buttons]

    H --> I[User selects a word button]
    I --> J[Store selectedWord and update selected label]

    J --> K[User enters match count and submits]
    K --> L[Validate selection and match count]

    L -->|Invalid| M[Show error message]
    M --> K

    L -->|Valid| N[Append attempt to history]
    N --> O[Run solver with currentList and attempt history]

    O --> P[Update currentList with filtered results]
    O --> R[Catch solver error and show message]

    P --> Q[Render updated word list and history]
    Q --> K

    R --> K